 "remarks": "An exceptional opportunity to enjoy Greenwich at an attractive price point! This inviting Pemberwick home offers 4 bedrooms and 3 full baths, featuring a new roof, new siding, and new gas water heater for added peace of mind. The versatile layout includes one main-level bedroom and three upstairs, including a flexible two-bedroom suite. Generous storage, main-level laundry, and new appliances add everyday convenience. The finished walk-out lower level, complete with full bath, offers excellent flexibility for a family room, additional bedroom, or potential in-law suite. Enjoy outdoor living on the spacious deck overlooking a large, fully fenced backyard, along with the convenience of a garage. Ideally located near Pemberwick Park and playground, with easy access to downtown Greenwich, Metro-North, shopping, dining, beaches, parks, the marina, ferry, and town pool. Enjoy more space, versatility, and the Greenwich lifestyle, all with convenient access to New York City.",
